免费游戏不计入排名，所以这份榜单对想买游戏或硬件的人更有参考价值。本周销量最高的是《使命召唤：现代战争4》。", "《影之刃零》排名第二。《AION 2》第三，《足球经理27》第四。独立游戏《深空当铺：可能是偷的》第五，《EA SPORTS FC 27》第六。", "初代《使命召唤》排在第七。《最终幻想14》第八，《Moon Sweepers》第九，《Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered》排在第十。"], "body": "Valve posted the list on Thursday. As always, free games are not counted, so the chart is a better guide for people who want to buy games or hardware. This week, Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 was the biggest seller.\n\nPhantom Blade Zero took second place. AION 2 was third, and Football Manager 27 came in fourth. The indie game Pawn Shop in Deep Space: Probably Stolen was fifth, and EA SPORTS FC 27 was sixth.\n\nThe original Call of Duty finished seventh. Final Fantasy 14 was eighth, Moon Sweepers was ninth, and Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered closed the top ten.", "body_zh": "Valve在周四公布了这份榜单。和往常一样，免费游戏不计入排名，所以这份榜单对想买游戏或硬件的人更有参考价值。本周销量最高的是《使命召唤：现代战争4》。\n\n《影之刃零》排名第二。《AION 2》第三，《足球经理27》第四。独立游戏《深空当铺：可能是偷的》第五，《EA SPORTS FC 27》第六。\n\n初代《使命召唤》排在第七。《最终幻想14》第八，《Moon Sweepers》第九，《Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered》排在第十。", "text": "Valve posted the list on Thursday. As always, free games are not counted, so the chart is a better guide for people who want to buy games or hardware. This week, Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 was the biggest seller. Phantom Blade Zero took second place. AION 2 was third, and Football Manager 27 came in fourth. The indie game Pawn Shop in Deep Space: Probably Stolen was fifth, and EA SPORTS FC 27 was sixth. The original Call of Duty finished seventh. Final Fantasy 14 was eighth, Moon Sweepers was ninth, and Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered closed the top ten.", "vocab": [{"word": "sales chart", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "销量榜", "note": "常用于游戏、音乐等排行榜", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "top", "pos": "verb", "zh": "登顶；位居第一", "note": "top the list 表示排在榜首", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "come in", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "排名（第几）", "note": "come in first/second 表示获得第